<title>SPAIN: Banesto says sold 9.9 pct of Asturiana.</title>
<headline>Banesto says sold 9.9 pct of Asturiana.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Corporacion Banesto said on Wednesday it has sold 9.91 percent of Asturiana de Zinc for 6.04 billion pesetas to a group of institutional investors.</p>
<p>Corporacion Banesto is part of the Banco Espanol de Credito (Banesto) group.</p>
<p>The bank said its remaining stake in the zinc mining firm is now 32.77 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
